{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-utk","title":"subscribe-list all-issues 未包含已关闭issues，前端无法显示已关闭的问题","description":"## 问题\n\n前端通过 subscribe-list 订阅 { type: 'all-issues' } 获取 issues 列表，但后端 MapSubscriptionToBdArgs 将 all-issues 映射为 `bd list --json --tree=false`，缺少 --all 参数。\n\n`bd list` 默认只返回 open 状态的 issues，需要 `--all` 才能包含已关闭的。\n\n对比：\n- handleListIssues（旧路由）已加 --all：`list --json --tree=false --all`\n- MapSubscriptionToBdArgs 的 all-issues 未加 --all：`list --json --tree=false`\n\n导致前端 Board 视图「已关闭」列为空，Issues 视图筛选「已关闭」无数据。\n\n## 修复\n\n在 list_adapters.go 中 all-issues case 的命令参数加上 --all。","status":"closed","priority":0,"issue_type":"bug","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T05:54:01Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:46:52Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T05:55:06Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T06:10:54Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/1","labels":["后端","数据同步"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
