{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-0a2","title":"搜索与筛选能力增强","description":"## 目标\n增强 Issues 列表和全局搜索能力，支持多维度筛选和全文搜索。\n\n## 子任务\n- 支持按 assignee 筛选\n- 支持按标签筛选（多选）\n- 支持按创建时间/更新时间范围筛选\n- 支持按优先级范围筛选\n- 全文搜索：搜索标题+描述内容（当前只搜标题和ID）\n- 搜索历史记录（localStorage）\n- URL hash 同步筛选状态（刷新不丢失筛选条件）\n- 筛选条件组合/清除\n\n## 背景\n当前筛选功能仅支持按状态/类型筛选和简单的标题搜索，对于管理大量 Issue 的项目不够用。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"epic","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T20:19:31Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:03Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T20:30:07Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T20:31:48Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/18","labels":["前端","搜索","筛选"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-gxw","title":"Epics视图功能完善","description":"## 目标\n将当前简单的 Epics 表格升级为可交互的 Epic 管理视图，支持展开子任务、创建子任务等。\n\n## 子任务\n- Epic 行可展开显示子任务列表\n- 子任务显示状态/优先级，支持直接修改\n- 子任务支持点击打开详情面板\n- 从 Epic 直接创建子任务（带 parent 关联）\n- Epic 进度条可点击查看详细完成情况\n- 支持 bd epic close-eligible 操作（一键关闭满足条件的 Epic）\n- Epics 筛选：按状态筛选（open/closed）\n\n## 背景\n当前 EpicsView.vue 只显示 epic 类型 issue 的表格和进度条，无法查看或管理子任务，实用性有限。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"epic","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T20:19:14Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:03Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T20:28:14Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T20:29:51Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/19","labels":["Epics","前端"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-aka","title":"Board看板交互增强","description":"## 目标\n将当前静态的 Board 看板升级为可交互的拖拽式看板，支持拖拽改状态、卡片展开预览等。\n\n## 子任务\n- 实现拖拽功能：卡片可跨列拖拽以改变 Issue 状态\n- 拖拽后自动调用 update-status 更新后端\n- 卡片增加更多预览信息：描述摘要、assignee、标签\n- 卡片点击展开为详情面板（与 Epic 1 联动）\n- 支持在列内拖拽排序（可选）\n- 新建 Issue 时支持直接在指定列创建\n- 响应式布局优化（小屏幕适配）\n\n## 背景\n当前 BoardView.vue 只是静态展示四列卡片，不支持拖拽交互，用户体验较差。现代看板工具的核心交互是拖拽。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"epic","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T20:18:57Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:04Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T20:26:52Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T20:27:58Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/20","labels":["前端","拖拽","看板"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-9v7","title":"ComputeDelta无法检测issue更新，因为updated_at是字符串而toFloat不解析字符串","description":"## 问题\n\n前端 snapshot 中 created_at/updated_at/closed_at 全为 0，导致：\n1. 前端无法正确显示时间\n2. ComputeDelta 无法检测 issue 更新，更新操作不触发推送\n\n### 根因\n\nbd list --json 返回的时间字段是字符串格式 \"2026-05-23T05:56:05Z\"，但后端有两个函数直接丢弃了字符串：\n\n1. **toTimestamp（list_adapters.go:161）**：normalizeIssueList 中处理 created_at/updated_at/closed_at 时，字符串时间戳返回 0，导致前端 snapshot 中这些字段全为 0\n2. **toFloat（subscriptions.go:213）**：ToItemsMap 中处理 updated_at 时，字符串时间戳返回 (0, false)，导致 ComputeDelta 无法检测更新\n\n### 修复\n\n修改 toTimestamp 和 toFloat，支持解析 RFC3339 字符串时间戳为 Unix 毫秒数。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T05:58:52Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:05Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T06:04:04Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T06:10:55Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/21","labels":["后端","增量计算","数据同步"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-5iz","title":"WebSocket缺少心跳机制，空闲连接可能被静默断开","description":"## 问题\n\n当前 WebSocket 连接没有心跳机制：\n- 后端没有定时 ping/pong，没有设置 ReadDeadline/WriteDeadline\n- 前端没有定时发 ping\n- 长时间空闲后，中间层（Nginx/防火墙）或操作系统可能静默断开连接\n- 前端可能不知道连接已断\n\n## 修复方向\n\n前端每30秒发送应用层 ping，后端回复 pong。超时未收到回复则视为断连，触发重连。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T05:41:26Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:05Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T05:41:34Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T05:43:00Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/22","labels":["WebSocket","可靠性","后端"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-joj","title":"前端未使用subscribe-list订阅导致文件变更无法实时推送到UI","description":"## 问题\n\n后端 watcher 检测到 issues.jsonl 变化后会调用 ScheduleListRefresh()，但该方法依赖 collectActiveListSpecs() 收集活跃的 subscribe-list 订阅。当前前端 stores/issues.js 只使用 send('list-issues') 做一次性请求，从未发送 subscribe-list 订阅，导致：\n\n1. collectActiveListSpecs() 返回空数组\n2. refreshAllActiveListSubscriptions() 无订阅可刷新\n3. 文件变更无法实时反映到前端\n\n## 修复方向\n\n前端需要在加载时发送 subscribe-list，并监听服务端推送的 snapshot/upsert/delete 事件来更新本地 issues 状态。\n\n## 关联\n\n- watcher 应仅监听 issues.jsonl（bd-ui-7so）已修复\n- 本 issue 是实时推送链路的另一断裂点","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T05:14:12Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:06Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T05:38:39Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/23","labels":["WebSocket","前端","数据同步"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-7so","title":"watcher应仅监听issues.jsonl而非整个.beads目录","description":"## 问题 当前 DbWatcher 在目录模式下（.beads/ 目录）设置 currentFile 为空字符串，导致目录内所有文件变化都会触发前端刷新。## 修复 将 watcher.go 中目录模式下的 currentFile 改为 issues.jsonl。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T05:11:06Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:07Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T05:38:40Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/24","labels":["后端","文件监听"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-4j8","title":"IssueDetail中description字段未展示","description":"bd list 返回的描述字段名为 description，但前端 IssueDetail.vue 中使用的是 issue.body，导致描述内容不显示。已修复：将 issue.body 改为 issue.description。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-22T22:52:32Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:07Z","closed_at":"2026-05-22T22:53:00Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/25","labels":["前端","详情面板"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-7zj","title":"bd list 默认不返回已关闭的issue，前端无法看到已关闭的问题","description":"后端 handleListIssues 调用 bd list --json --tree=false 时没有加 --all 参数，导致默认只返回 open 状态的 issue。前端筛选已关闭时无法看到数据。已修复：在 ws.go 中添加了 --all 参数。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-22T22:46:27Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:08Z","closed_at":"2026-05-22T22:47:39Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/26","labels":["后端","数据同步"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-342","title":"暗色主题下页面背景还是白色","description":"暗色模式下，切换到暗色主题后页面背景仍然是白色，没有正确应用暗色背景色。需要检查 CSS 变量在 html.dark 类下的覆盖是否生效。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-22T22:39:27Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:09Z","closed_at":"2026-05-22T22:42:00Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/27","labels":["主题","前端","样式"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-43z","title":"前端保存最后一次打开的工作空间","description":"页面刷新后，自动恢复用户最后一次选择的工作空间，而不是使用服务端默认值。使用 localStorage 保存最后一次选择的工作空间路径，WebSocket 连接成功后优先恢复该路径。","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-22T21:36:08Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:56:07Z","started_at":"2026-05-22T21:36:15Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T22:56:07Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/28","metadata":null,"labels":["体验","前端","工作空间"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-kqd","title":"清理 i18n 中不再使用的翻译 key","description":"移除 newIssue、confirm.delete、ws.createFail、ws.deleteFail 等不再被引用的翻译 key。","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"chore","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T21:50:50Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:10Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T21:56:24Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/29","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"bd-ui-kqd","depends_on_id":"bd-ui-7d5","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-24T05:51:18Z","created_by":"limengwei","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-9kp","title":"依赖关系可视化与管理","description":"## 目标\n实现 Issue 间依赖关系的可视化管理，支持依赖图展示和交互式依赖操作。\n\n## 子任务\n- 依赖图可视化视图（使用 dagre/d3 等库渲染有向无环图）\n- Issue 详情中展示依赖链（前置依赖和后续被依赖）\n- 支持从详情面板添加/移除依赖\n- 依赖冲突检测提示（循环依赖警告）\n- Board 视图中阻塞列显示阻塞原因（被哪些 Issue 阻塞）\n- 依赖图支持点击节点跳转到 Issue 详情\n\n## 背景\n当前依赖关系只显示为 dep_ids 数组（一串 ID），无法直观理解 Issue 间的依赖结构。beads 的核心特性是依赖管理，但 UI 层面几乎没有体现。","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"epic","assignee":"limengwei","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T20:20:08Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:47:11Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T20:33:33Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T20:35:43Z","close_reason":"Closed","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/30","labels":["依赖图","依赖管理","前端"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"bd-ui-1l7","title":"用户体验与交互优化","description":"## 目标\n提升整体用户体验，添加键盘快捷键、批量操作、Markdown 渲染等常用功能。\n\n## 子任务\n- 键盘快捷键：N 新建、/ 聚焦搜索、Esc 关闭弹窗、上下箭头选择 Issue\n- 批量操作：多选 Issue 后批量改状态/优先级/标签/删除\n- 描述字段 Markdown 渲染（使用 markdown-it 或类似库）\n- NewIssueDialog 增强：支持设置 assignee、标签、parent\n- Issue 列表支持排序（按优先级/更新时间/创建时间）\n- 通知/toast 统一优化（操作反馈更清晰）\n- 首次使用引导（空状态引导创建第一个 Issue）\n- 加载骨架屏（skeleton）替代简单的 loading\n\n## 背景\n当前 UI 功能基本可用但交互体验偏简单，缺少现代 Web 应用常见的快捷键、批量操作等效率工具。","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"epic","owner":"limengweiwei@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-23T20:19:49Z","created_by":"limengwei","updated_at":"2026-05-23T22:56:08Z","started_at":"2026-05-23T20:32:05Z","closed_at":"2026-05-23T22:56:08Z","external_ref":"https://github.com/limengwei/bd-ui/issues/31","metadata":null,"labels":["体验","前端","快捷键"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
